*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

## Visual Studio cache/options
.vs/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

## ReSharper / Rider
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user
.idea/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

## Build / publish
[Pp]ublish/
publish/
*.Publish.xml
*.azurePubxml
PublishScripts/

## MSTest / Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info

## Windows / OS junk
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

## Misc
*.cache
*.log
*.tlog
*.pdb
*.tmp
*.tmp_proj
*_wpftmp.csproj
*.pidb
*.svclog
*.scc

